<title>UK: SMM sets 450 billion lire two-year FRN.</title>
<headline>SMM sets 450 billion lire two-year FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by lead manager JP Morgan.</p>
<p> BORROWER   SMM CO BV</p>
<p> AMT    450 BLN ITL   BASE	 6M-LIBOR  MATURITY    22.JAN.99</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     FLAT	PAY DATE    22.JAN.97</p>
<p> LAST MOODY =	   ISS PRICE  PAR	 FULL FEES   =</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   AAA	 REOFFER    =</p>
<p> NOTES	SMM CO BV IS A SPECIAL PURPOSE VEHICLE</p>
<p> LISTING    LONDON    DENOMS (M) 100	 SALE LIMITS US/UK/NL</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    N.Y	 PAY FREQ   SEMI-ANN</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
